00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:29.380
to get involved in anti-communist activity
and establish an organization called the John

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:37.810
Birch Society. This organization tended to
be of a conspiratorial, conspiratorial bent,

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:44.770
with the major highlight being that Welch
