00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:53.210
which of course, is is ridiculous. But he
continued to establish this John Birch Society

00:01:53.210 --> 00:02:00.940
and in it, and it became the the most powerful
anti-communist organization in the in the

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:09.239
early 1960s, late 1950s. And as I argue in
the book, had influence even into the 70s

00:02:09.239 --> 00:02:15.099
during the the the age of Reagan, of which
